<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<LanguageData>
  <!-- EN: use poison bottle -->
  <Kiiro_PoisonBottle_Label>使用毒药</Kiiro_PoisonBottle_Label>
  <!-- EN: Toggle the use of carried poison. When enabled, Kiiro will be able to apply poison to arrows or throwing weapons. Each shot consumes one unit of poison reserves. -->
  <Kiiro_PoisonBottle_Desc>切换是否使用随身携带的毒药。开启后，当绮罗手持绮罗族的弓弩或暗器类武器时，能够发射涂有毒药的箭矢或飞镖。每一次射击消耗一点毒药存量。</Kiiro_PoisonBottle_Desc>
  <!-- EN: stealth skill -->
  <Kiiro_StealthSkill_Label>潜行</Kiiro_StealthSkill_Label>
  <!-- EN: Toggle the stealth skill. When enabled, Kiiro is able to conceal their movements in dark or smoky environments. However, performing any attack action will break the stealth and expose them. -->
  <Kiiro_StealthSkill_Desc>切换潜行状态。开启后，绮罗能够在黑暗或充满烟雾的环境里隐藏自己的行踪。做出攻击行为会暴露。</Kiiro_StealthSkill_Desc>
  <!-- EN: Kiiro relationship: hostile -->
  <Kiiro_HostileToKiiro_Label>绮罗关系：敌对</Kiiro_HostileToKiiro_Label>
  <!-- EN: Perceiving the hostility we have displayed, the Kiiros believe that towns exposed in our sight will no longer be safe. Kiiro messengers will spread the news of our hostile actions to all their towns for a certain period of time. -->
  <Kiiro_HostileToKiiro_Desc>察觉到我们表现出的敌意，绮罗族认为暴露在我们视野中的城镇将不再安全。绮罗的信使会在一段时间内将发现我们敌对行为的消息传达到她们的全部城镇。</Kiiro_HostileToKiiro_Desc>
  <!-- EN: Kiiro relationship: neutral -->
  <Kiiro_NeutralToKiiro_Label>绮罗关系：中立</Kiiro_NeutralToKiiro_Label>
  <!-- EN: The relationship with the Kiiros has been restored to neutral. However, we have not gained their full trust, and until we demonstrate sufficient goodwill, the Kiiros will remain cautious of our actions. -->
  <Kiiro_NeutralToKiiro_Desc>和绮罗族的关系已经恢复至中立。我们并没有获得绮罗族的完全信任，在表达出足够的善意之前，绮罗族仍然会警惕我们的行为。</Kiiro_NeutralToKiiro_Desc>
  <!-- EN: Kiiro relationship: ally -->
  <Kiiro_AllyToKiiro_Label>绮罗关系：盟友</Kiiro_AllyToKiiro_Label>
  <!-- EN: We have allied ourselves with the kiiros, and they now consider us to be a trusted friend. Kiiro messengers will spread the news of our alliance to distant towns, which will take some time. -->
  <Kiiro_AllyToKiiro_Desc>我们已经和绮罗族结为盟友，现在她们认为我们是值得信任的朋友。绮罗的信使会将结盟的消息传达到远方的城镇，这会花费一点时间。</Kiiro_AllyToKiiro_Desc>
  <!-- EN: Kiiro messengers are on their way -->
  <Kiiro_KiiroHide_Label>绮罗信使奔走中</Kiiro_KiiroHide_Label>
  <!-- EN: Kiiro messengers are running between the towns, spreading the news about our hostile actions. -->
  <Kiiro_KiiroHide_Desc>绮罗信使正在奔走于各个城镇之间传达关于我们敌对行为的消息。</Kiiro_KiiroHide_Desc>
  <!-- EN: Progress of message delivery: -->
  <Kiiro_KiiroHide_Desc_Schedule>传达消息进度：</Kiiro_KiiroHide_Desc_Schedule>
  <!-- EN: Kiiro special forces raid -->
  <Kiiro_KiiroNightRaid_Label>黑夜突袭</Kiiro_KiiroNightRaid_Label>
  <!-- EN: A small, highly trained elite special forces of Kiiros has launched a surprise attack under the cover of darkness! They will commence the assault immediately. -->
  <Kiiro_KiiroNightRaid_Desc>一支训练有素的绮罗特战队趁着夜色发动了突袭！她们将立刻开始进攻。</Kiiro_KiiroNightRaid_Desc>
  <!-- EN: {0_label} has been abandoned. -->
  <Kiiro_KiiroSettlementRemove_Label>{0_label}已经废弃</Kiiro_KiiroSettlementRemove_Label>
  <!-- EN: {0_label} has disappeared from our map. -->
  <Kiiro_KiiroSettlementRemove_A_Desc>{0_label}从我们的地图上消失了。</Kiiro_KiiroSettlementRemove_A_Desc>
  <!-- EN: {0_label} no longer exists, leaving behind only empty and deserted buildings in its place. -->
  <Kiiro_KiiroSettlementRemove_B_Desc>{0_label}不复存在，原地只留下了空荡荡的房屋。</Kiiro_KiiroSettlementRemove_B_Desc>
  <!-- EN: We have lost the location information of {0_label}. -->
  <Kiiro_KiiroSettlementRemove_C_Desc>我们失去了{0_label}的位置信息。</Kiiro_KiiroSettlementRemove_C_Desc>
  <!-- EN: It appears that all the residents of {0_label} have already migrated, turning the town into an empty and abandoned city. -->
  <Kiiro_KiiroSettlementRemove_D_Desc>{0_label}的居民似乎已经全部迁移，这座城镇已然成为一座空城。</Kiiro_KiiroSettlementRemove_D_Desc>
  <!-- EN: All the Kiiro towns have disappeared -->
  <Kiiro_KiiroFactionRemove_Label>绮罗城镇全部消失</Kiiro_KiiroFactionRemove_Label>
  <!-- EN: All the Kiiro towns have become aware of our hostile actions, and we can no longer find any Kiiro settlements on the map. The Kiiros has severed all ties with us completely. -->
  <Kiiro_KiiroFactionRemove_Desc>绮罗的全部城镇都得知了我们的敌对行为，我们再也不能在地图上找到任何一个绮罗族城镇。绮罗族从此刻开始彻底与我们决裂。</Kiiro_KiiroFactionRemove_Desc>
  <!-- EN: Default -->
  <Kiiro_Setting_Initialization>恢复默认</Kiiro_Setting_Initialization>
  <!-- EN: Kiiro Race -->
  <Kiiro_Setting_Label>Kiiro Race</Kiiro_Setting_Label>
  <!-- EN: enable -->
  <Kiiro_Setting_True>启用</Kiiro_Setting_True>
  <!-- EN: disable -->
  <Kiiro_Setting_False>禁用</Kiiro_Setting_False>
  <!-- EN: Kiiro faction interactions -->
  <Kiiro_Setting_If_OpenMechanism>派系互动</Kiiro_Setting_If_OpenMechanism>
  <!-- EN: Decide whether to enable the entire faction interaction system, including mood, town abandonment, and special forces raids. Only recommended to disable when mod conflict occurs. -->
  <Kiiro_Setting_If_OpenMechanism_Desc>决定是否启用包括心情、城镇废弃和特战队突袭在内的整个派系互动机制。仅推荐在产生模组冲突时关闭。\n\n在启用绮罗事件拓展后，该选项会同时决定多种事件能否触发，推荐开启以获得事件拓展的全部体验。</Kiiro_Setting_If_OpenMechanism_Desc>
  <!-- EN: Town abandonment -->
  <Kiiro_Setting_If_OpenFactionRemove>城镇废弃</Kiiro_Setting_If_OpenFactionRemove>
  <!-- EN: Decide whether to enable the Kiiro faction town abandonment system. When enabled, Kiiro towns will gradually disappear as the duration of faction hostility increases. Only recommended to disable when mod conflict occurs. -->
  <Kiiro_Setting_If_OpenFactionRemove_Desc>决定是否启用绮罗族城镇废弃系统。开启后，绮罗族的城镇将随派系敌对时长的增加而逐渐消失。仅推荐在产生模组冲突时关闭。</Kiiro_Setting_If_OpenFactionRemove_Desc>
  <!-- EN: night raid -->
  <Kiiro_Setting_If_OpenNightRaid>黑夜突袭</Kiiro_Setting_If_OpenNightRaid>
  <!-- EN: Decide whether to enable the Special Forces Raid event. Only recommended to disable when mod conflict occurs. -->
  <Kiiro_Setting_If_OpenNightRaid_Desc>决定是否启用特战队突袭事件。仅推荐在产生模组冲突时关闭。</Kiiro_Setting_If_OpenNightRaid_Desc>
  <!-- EN: AI uses poison bottle -->
  <Kiiro_Setting_If_OpenPoisonBottle>AI使用毒药瓶</Kiiro_Setting_If_OpenPoisonBottle>
  <!-- EN: Decide whether non-player factions of the Kiiro can use poison bottles. -->
  <Kiiro_Setting_If_OpenPoisonBottle_Desc>非玩家派系的绮罗是否能够使用毒药瓶。</Kiiro_Setting_If_OpenPoisonBottle_Desc>
</LanguageData>